main.c
--floatbv
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Conversion and arithmetic on double whose rounding carries out of the
significand. With the non-FPA SMT encoding (e.g., --z3), float_bvt used to set
the most significant bit of the significand via 1 << 52 computed in int.
Complements Float-to-double-round-up, which covers conversion from binary128.
Regression test for GitHub issue #9200.
